<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32624" root="غور" body-key="g">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْوَارٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغِيرٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also A <i>fighting</i> man; and
so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَاوِرٌ</span></b> : (S:) or the former signifies one <i>who
occupies himself much in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَارَات</span> [or <i>raids,</i> or
<i>sudden attacks upon enemies,</i> or <i>upon the dwellings
of enemies, with armed horsemen,</i> &amp;c., pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">غَارَةٌ</span>];
(K, TA;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَاوِرٌ</span></b> : (TA:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغَاوِيرُ</span>: (S:)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَغَاوِرُ</span> may be a contracted pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِغْوَارٌ</span> or a
pl. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُغَاوِرٌ</span>. (TA.)

